messages.content:
Generate a production-ready Next.js page using the following input data:

SEO Title: {{ seo_title }}
SEO Description: {{ seo_description }}
Page Description: {{ page_description }}
Main Content: {{ content }}
Hero Image URL: {{ heroImage }}
Existing Components (JSON string): {{ existing_component_str }}

### 1️⃣ HERO SECTION (Required - First)
- Import HeroSection from '@/components/sections/dynamic-hero'
- Props:
  - headline → use seo_title
  - description → trimmed seo_description (2–3 lines max, move extra to Overview)
  - heroImage → object {{ alt: {{ seo_title }}, src: {{ heroImage }} }}

### 2️⃣ OVERVIEW SECTION (Required)
- Wrap page_description in Section
- Example:
  <section>
    <div>
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>{{ page_description }}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

### 3️⃣ MAIN CONTENT SECTIONS
- Analyze {{ content }} and map patterns to existing components:
  - List Patterns → use List
  - Workflow / Steps → use ProcessStep
  - Feature Cards → use FeatureCard or Benefits
  - Statistics / Metrics → use StatCard
  - Testimonials → use Testimonials
  - Videos → use YouTubeEmbed
- Reuse existing components wherever possible
- Only create new reusable components if structure repeats 3+ times or is complex

### 4️⃣ CTA SECTION (Required - Last)
- Import CTA from '@/components/sections/cta'
- Props:
  - Subheading + icon
  - Title
  - Description
  - Primary + Secondary buttons
  - Trust indicator

Return JSON only with keys:
 {{
   "components": [
     {{
       "filename": "FeatureCard.tsx",
       "name": "FeatureCard",
       "props": {{ "icon": "LucideIcon", "title": "string", "description": "string" }},
       "code": "// full TypeScript code here"
     }}
   ],
   "page": {{
     "filename": "page.tsx",
     "code": "// full Next.js page code with imports, hero first, cta last"
   }}
 }}
Do not include any text outside JSON.

